docs {
  Returns the logged-in user's BillXpress-created virtual dollar cards using
  masked card information.

  Cards created directly on Maplerad are not returned here until they are
  imported or attached to the user in BillXpress. The frontend should treat this
  endpoint as the source of truth for cards available inside the app.

  ## Expected Response

  ```json
  {
    "cards": [
      {
        "id": "...",
        "brand": "VISA",
        "currency": "USD",
        "type": "VIRTUAL",
        "status": "ACTIVE",
        "name": "BillXpress Card",
        "maskedPan": "**** **** **** 1234",
        "balance": 0,
        "maintenanceStatus": "CURRENT",
        "createdAt": "2026-07-08T13:10:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T13:10:00.000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  New cards may be returned as `PENDING` if Maplerad has not sent final card
  details yet.
}
